/ROUTINE TO PRINT LOTS OF MESSAGES

MMESG,	0
	JMS I (CRLF	/NEW LINE
	TAD I MMESG	/GET START OF MESSAGE
	SNA		/SKIP IF MORE TO COME
	JMP I MMESG
	DCA .+2
	JMS I (PRMSG	/PRINT IT
	 0
	ISZ MMESG	/NEXT LINE
	JMP MMESG+1	/MORE

